public static CampaignBattlesRow[] CAMPAIGNBATTLES = new CampaignBattlesRow[] {new CampaignBattlesRow("oath-1",1,1,"The Drowned Crossings",0,1,"easy",true,"Tidecaller raiders hold the river crossings above the drowned coast. Take them one at a time and teach your banner to follow you.","The Charter says every wrong is answered. This one first.","domination","gilded","o1_hold_all","none","tidecallers_easy","A Sunweaver's light sputters in her hand. Aldric: Damp powder. See that it is dry.",false,"none"),new CampaignBattlesRow("oath-2",1,2,"The Moon Shrine Watch",3,2,"easy",false,"The graves of Hollowwood are opening under the moon. Hold the shrine with the Order's second banner until the dead lie still.","The dead wear colours no one has worn in a lifetime.","survival","gilded","o2_lose8","ally_gilded_easy","none","Aldric reads the faded colours. Tengervald. Struck from the relief list two lifetimes ago. Someone is still answering for it.",false,"none"),new CampaignBattlesRow("oath-3",1,3,"Smoke at Ironhold",1,2,"normal",false,"Tidecallers hold the Ironhold gate and the Ironclad cannot take it back alone. Bring their engines up, break the gate, take the keep.","The river under Ironhold runs the wrong colour. No one asks why.","siege","gilded","o3_gate_by","ally_ironclad_normal","tidecallers_normal,tidecallers_normal","The smith thanks the Order and does not meet Aldric's eye. A dying raider says one word. Admiral.",false,"none"),new CampaignBattlesRow("oath-4",1,4,"The Hunters' Road",2,2,"normal",false,"The council orders the grazing lands cleared for the quarry road. The wagon carries the hunters. Walk beside it through the pass.","Aldric read the order twice. This is the hunt again.","convoy","gilded","o4_never_rolled","ally_gilded_normal","wildmoot_normal,wildmoot_normal","A boar-kin hunter in the snow: We hid for a hundred years. We stopped hiding.",true,"none"),new CampaignBattlesRow("oath-5",1,5,"The Grazing Grounds",3,3,"normal",false,"The grass is ripe and the order is to burn it. Take the grazing grounds before the herds come back for them.","The quarry road needs the plain. The herds were there first.","domination","gilded","o5_lose12","ally_gilded_normal,ally_gilded_normal_b","wildmoot_normal,wildmoot_normal,wildmoot_normal","The fire does not catch. A quarryman says the stone is cold in the cut.",true,"none"),new CampaignBattlesRow("oath-6",1,6,"The Antlered Alpha",4,3,"hard",false,"The quarry road is open and the Wildmoot have come to close it. Old Horn leads them. Hold the five crossings and break his line.","At the cut lies a carved stone the size of a house.","domination","gilded","o6_hold_all","ally_gilded_normal,ally_gilded_normal_b","wildmoot_hard,wildmoot_normal,wildmoot_normal","The Wildmoot line breaks and Old Horn withdraws. Aldric asks what the stone is. Stone, says the quarryman. Aldric orders it covered.",true,"none")};
